The parameter you want is

   adapt_delta

in the control parameters.

We really need to write some more thorough CmdStan and RStan doc (I'm afraid
I don't know the state of the PyStan doc)!  As is,
the control parameters only make sense if you know the guts of NUTS.

Feel free to review the RStan and jot down what needs to be clarified.

The doc for CmdStan (command-line Stan) in the manual is much better for
the 2.0 release than it was before, and it's getting better
as Michael adds more details and examples.  Michael's
also planning to use his copious free time to write some descriptions
of the samplers in the manual that are independent of the command-line options.
Here's the feature request:

   https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/354?source=cc

That should take some of the pressure off of the RStan and PyStan docs if
the terminology is consistent.

There is scattered discussion now, but nothing organized and thorough.

- Bob

