From uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com  Fri Dec  6 21:08:43 2013
From: uda33143a8db60ce8 at groups.google.com (Andrew Gelman)
Date: Fri, 06 Dec 2013 21:08:43 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] stepsizes
Message-ID: <Q0i3aK5WR_I.Dgi3-cZqN4QJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Q0i3aK5WR_I.-FJFM2Fy44AJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <Q0i3aK5WR_I.DvUDr53b1AUJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <Q0i3aK5WR_I.-FJFM2Fy44AJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
