From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Sat Dec 21 18:32:53 2013
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Sat, 21 Dec 2013 18:32:53 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] CmdStan 2.1.0 is just about ready to go out.
Message-ID: <gyCh9ow7P_w.aJBP8jvzhGQJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <gyCh9ow7P_w.UGYp49LvakYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
